===Etymology===
Probably {{etyl|it|en}} (dial. [[Lombardy]]) {{term|arigola|lang=it}}. (Eng. usg. 1967)

Cognate to {{term|rocket||plant|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{enPR|əʹro͞ogələ}}, {{IPA|/əˈɹuɡələ/|lang=en}}
* {{hyphenation|a|ru|gu|la|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|arugula}}

# One of three yellowish-flowered [[Mediterranean]] [[herb]] of the [[mustard]] family; which has flavoured leaves, often eaten in [[salad]]s. Has a distinct, [[peppery]] flavor:
## ''[[Eruca sativa]]'', sometimes {{taxlink|Eruca vesicaria subsp. sativa|subspecies|noshow=1}}
## ''[[Eruca vesicaria]]''
## {{taxlink|Diplotaxis tenuifolia|species|noshow=1}}

